# Skill Guard — overrides file

When the user says **Always allow** in **Cursor chat**, merge into `.cursor/skill-guard-overrides.json`:

```json
{
  "session_allow_keys": [],
  "always_allow_keys": [],
  "always_allow_reason_codes": ["database_url"]
}
```

Control UI is in chat — see rule `skill-guard-chat-control` (always on).
